</h3><div class="tl-sale-info-wrapper"><ul class="tpm-sale-card__item-infos"></ul></div></div></div></div><ul class="tpm-list tpm-sale-card__item-features tpm-list--blue-hook"><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">轻量精排模型</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">公开网页信源</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">指定时间范围检索</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">标准摘要</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">图片列表</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">结果返回条数5～10条</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">结果相关性得分</span></li></ul><footer class="tpm-sale-card__item-ft"><div class="tpm-sale-card__item-prices"><div class="tpm-sale-card__item-price"><em>18</em>元/千次</div></div><div class="tpm-sale-card__item-btns"><a href="https://buy.cloud.tencent.com/buywsa" class="tpm-btn tpm-btn--primary"><span class="tpm-btn__text">立即购买</span></a></div></footer></div></div></div></div></div></div><div style="padding-bottom:60px" id="-YVF9ArIr" data-id="-YVF9ArIr" class="with-gap bg-gray"><header class="tpm-section__hd" style="padding-top:60px" id="zOg-VcSnAJ" data-id="zOg-VcSnAJ"><h2 class="tl-anchor tpm-section__title">产品特性</h2></header><div class="view-column"><div><div class="tp-grid__layout"><div><div class="tp-grid__row tp-grid--gutter-8n"><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--6 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><div class="tpm-feature__item"><img src="https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/tc_portal_icon/9b08b97d-693d-42c9-ba13-de431e76c863.png" alt="" class="tpm-feature__item-icon"/><div class="tpm-feature__item-bd"><h3 class="tpm-feature__item-title">大模型友好</h3><div class="tpm-feature__item-desc">从数据收录到智能召回，全链路为大模型重新构建，信息自动去噪，节省Token成本，大模型可直接使用无需二次处理。</div></div></div></div><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--6 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><div class="tpm-feature__item"><img src="https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/tc_portal_icon/e0849049-ebd8-46c0-86ca-abf84afb6800.png" alt="" class="tpm-feature__item-icon"/><div class="tpm-feature__item-bd"><h3 class="tpm-feature__item-title">毫秒级响应</h3><div class="tpm-feature__item-desc">借助分布式计算+边缘节点缓存，最快300ms返回结果，实现快速稳定的高性能体验。
</div></div></div></div><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--6 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><div class="tpm-feature__item"><img src="https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/tc_portal_icon/971b5408-c19b-4de7-bfbb-6db21be4cf86.png" alt="" class="tpm-feature__item-icon"/><div class="tpm-feature__item-bd"><h3 class="tpm-feature__item-title">分钟级更新</h3><div class="tpm-feature__item-desc">提供高时效性内容检索，实时获取政策更新、新闻动态、天气变化、实时行情等最新信息。</div></div></div></div><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--6 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><div class="tpm-feature__item"><img src="https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/tc_portal_icon/12f9d881-89ae-4270-954d-8e35ad85b57b.png" alt="" class="tpm-feature__item-icon"/><div class="tpm-feature__item-bd"><h3 class="tpm-feature__item-title">海量资源库</h3><div class="tpm-feature__item-desc">全网内容分层聚类精准索引，融合腾讯优质内容生态，包括腾讯新闻、搜狗百科、企鹅号等内容，覆盖各类优质资源。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tl-scene-media with-gap" style="padding-bottom:60px" id="P0vwgZ7yg" data-id="P0vwgZ7yg"><header class="tpm-section__hd" style="padding-top:60px" id="yEI3DSeRF6" data-id="yEI3DSeRF6"><h2 class="tl-anchor tpm-section__title">应用场景</h2></header><div class="tl-tabs tl-tabs--inset"><div class="view-column"><div class="tl-tabs__bar"><ul class="tl-tabs__list"><li class="tl-tabs__item is-active"><div class="tl-tabs__item-cont is-active">模型智答万物</div></li><li class="tl-tabs__item"><div class="tl-tabs__item-cont">智能办公提效</div></li><li class="tl-tabs__item"><div class="tl-tabs__item-cont">智慧座舱升级</div></li><li class="tl-tabs__item"><div class="tl-tabs__item-cont">智能硬件革新</div></li><li class="tl-tabs__item"><div class="tl-tabs__item-cont">更多</div></li></ul></div></div><div class="view-column"><div class="tl-tabs__cont" style="padding:40px"><div class="tl-tabs__panel" style="transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease;transform-origin:center;flex-shrink:0"><div><div class="tp-grid__row tpm-media right-img"><div class="tp-grid__col tpm-media__content"><div class="tpm-group"><div class="tpm-group__tit m-hidden">模型智答万物</div><div class="tpm-group__bd"><p>联网搜索API实时检索打破大模型知识过期的困局，让模型生成与事实核查同步进行，答案准确率从模糊推测跃升至溯源级精准，为用户提供更精准、更可信的答案。</p></div></div><div class="tpm-group"><div class="tpm-group__tit">典型场景示例</div><div class="tpm-group__bd"><ul class="tpm-list tpm-list--blue-hook"><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">AI搜索：借助联网搜索，AI搜索能够即刻更新其知识库，提供最新的行业数据、科研成果或市场趋势，用户在搜索时可获得实时、精准的信息支持，提升搜索体验。</span></li><li class="tpm-list__item"><span class="tpm-list__item-text">智能对话助手：通过接入联网搜索，结合实时信息检索与大模型生成能力，能够准确理解并快速回应用户的多样化问题，为用户提供更精确的答案，解决因知识过期或不准确导致的常见问题。</span></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="tp-grid__col tpm-media__object" style="padding-left:0"><img src="https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/MgirtwWhVEc9NquaNsZ80.png" alt=""/></div></div></div></div><div class="tl-tabs__panel" style="height:0;width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;padding:0;margin:0;pointer-events:none;display:block;transform:translate3d(0, 10px, 0);transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease;transform-origin:center;flex-shrink:0"></div><div class="tl-tabs__panel" style="height:0;width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;padding:0;margin:0;pointer-events:none;display:block;transform:translate3d(0, 10px, 0);transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease;transform-origin:center;flex-shrink:0"></div><div class="tl-tabs__panel" style="height:0;width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;padding:0;margin:0;pointer-events:none;display:block;transform:translate3d(0, 10px, 0);transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease;transform-origin:center;flex-shrink:0"></div><div class="tl-tabs__panel" style="height:0;width:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;padding:0;margin:0;pointer-events:none;display:block;transform:translate3d(0, 10px, 0);transition:opacity .45s ease, transform .45s ease;transform-origin:center;flex-shrink:0"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tpm-case3 with-gap" id="EPSiqIF6Z" data-id="EPSiqIF6Z"><div class="tpm-case3__section"><div class="tpm-case3__section-bg" style="background-image:url(https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/raw/7db1e437207315e9d9385bb24ae59a96.jpeg)"></div><div class="tpm-case3__section-main"><h2 class="tl-anchor tpm-case3__title">客户案例</h2><p class="tpm-case3__desc">通过接入联网搜索，客户能够实时获取最新的全网信息，提升智能化水平，快速响应市场变化，确保在动态市场环境中保持领先，从而进一步提升业务运作的精度和速度，增强市场竞争力。</p><div class="tl-swiper tpm-case-card__list"><div class="swiper swiper-container"><div class="swiper-wrapper"><div class="swiper-slide"><a class="tpm-case-card tpm-case-card--vertical"><div class="tpm-case-card__bg"></div><div class="tpm-case-card__inner"><div class="tpm-case-card__object"><img src="https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/2Tts3ozI8jFYepM9TPA68.png" alt="" class="tpm-case-card__logo"/></div><div class="tpm-case-card__main"><h4 class="tpm-case-card__title">腾讯元宝</h4><div class="tpm-case-card__desc">接入联网搜索后，腾讯元宝打破了大模型知识过期的困局，当用户提问时效权威问题时，系统自动穿透全网权威信源，实时获取最新资讯、政府官网、政策文件，答案准确率从模糊推测跃升至溯源级精准。</div></div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a class="tpm-case-card tpm-case-card--vertical"><div class="tpm-case-card__bg"></div><div class="tpm-case-card__inner"><div class="tpm-case-card__object"><img src="https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/SvFL5pd-bO7rI64hXcux9.png" alt="" class="tpm-case-card__logo"/></div><div class="tpm-case-card__main"><h4 class="tpm-case-card__title">QQ浏览器</h4><div class="tpm-case-card__desc">QQ浏览器进行信息获取-处理-应用的全链路重构，整合AI搜索、智能浏览、多模态文档处理与智能体（Agent）任务执行等能力，重塑浏览器的功能边界与用户体验，将浏览器从被动检索工具升级为主动生产力伙伴。</div></div></div></a></div><div class="swiper-slide"><a class="tpm-case-card tpm-case-card--vertical"><div class="tpm-case-card__bg"></div><div class="tpm-case-card__inner"><div class="tpm-case-card__object"><img src="https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/ydo_3eGA0xoJvifwlQaNa.png" alt="" class="tpm-case-card__logo"/></div><div class="tpm-case-card__main"><h4 class="tpm-case-card__title">腾讯地图</h4><div class="tpm-case-card__desc">腾讯地图使用联网搜索为产品增加了用户信息获取宽度，通过实时数据整合​和场景化服务​，实现从“工具”到“生活助手”的升级。用户可随时获取动态信息，高效决策，降低出行成本，全面提升生活便利性。</div></div></div></a></div></div><button class="tl-swiper__btn tl-swiper__btn--prev" style="display:none"><div class="tl-swiper__btn-inner">上一页</div></button><button class="tl-swiper__btn tl-swiper__btn--next" style="display:none"><div class="tl-swiper__btn-inner">下一页</div></button><div class="tl-swiper__pages" style="display:none"></div></div></div></div></div><div class="tl-logos"><div class="view-column"><div class="tpm-logo-card__wrap tpm-logo-card__wrap--fixcol"><div class="tpm-logo-card__wrap-inner"><ul class="tpm-logo-card__list"><li><a class="tpm-logo-card"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img-wrap"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/b1lqWSdV1uSb-bL4rhqoJ.png&quot;)">快手</div></div></a></li><li><a class="tpm-logo-card"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img-wrap"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/oMw0Jpa-bAOEtSZZl57Rt.png&quot;)">晶泰科技</div></div></a></li><li><a class="tpm-logo-card"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img-wrap"><div class="tpm-logo-card__img" style="background-image:url(&quot;https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/Wj4vowttx1Zc3u_vmAY5v.png&quot;)">人民网</div></div></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div><div style="padding-bottom:60px" id="QF1fHud9z" data-id="QF1fHud9z" class="with-gap"><header class="tpm-section__hd" style="padding-top:60px" id="PdaubF67_3" data-id="PdaubF67_3"><h2 class="tl-anchor tpm-section__title">帮助与文档</h2></header><div class="view-column"><div class="tpm-doc"><div class="tp-grid__row tpm-doc__list"><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--8 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1806/121794" class="tpm-doc__item"><h3 class="tpm-doc__item-title">产品简介</h3><div class="tpm-doc__item-desc">帮助您快速了解联网搜索API服务的概述、优势、应用场景等。</div></a></div><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--8 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1806/121802" class="tpm-doc__item"><h3 class="tpm-doc__item-title">使用指南</h3><div class="tpm-doc__item-desc">帮助您快速开通、接入联网搜索API服务。</div></a></div><div class="tp-grid__col tp-grid__col--8 tp-grid__col--pad-12 tp-grid__col--phone-24"><a href="https://cloud.tencent.com/document/product/1806/121798" class="tpm-doc__item"><h3 class="tpm-doc__item-title">计费模式</h3><div class="tpm-doc__item-desc">支持按量计费（后付费）和资源包（预付费）两种计费模式。</div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div id="yCLcHRE33" data-id="yCLcHRE33" class="tl-faq-list tpm-faq__list with-gap bg-gray"><header class="tpm-section__hd" style="padding-top:60px" id="sVfH94GfR8" data-id="sVfH94GfR8"><h2 class="tl-anchor tpm-section__title">常见问题</h2></header><div class="view-column" style="margin-bottom:40px"><div class="tpm-faq__item is-open"><div class="tpm-faq__item-hd"><h3 class="tpm-faq__item-title">什么是联网搜索API？</h3><i class="tpm-faq__item-icon"></i></div><div class="tpm-faq__item-bd"><div class="tpm-rich-text"><p class="ts-p">联网搜索（Web Search API，wsa）来源于搜狗搜索，以互联网全网公开资源为基础，实现了从收录至召回排序全链路的智能搜索增强。合作伙伴通过检索词请求接口，以 JSON 形式返回搜索结果对应的排序信息、数据字段。同时合作伙伴可在业务场景中结合搜索结果的内容，扩充信息内容源，丰富展现效果，提升用户的查询满意度。</p></div></div></div><div class="tpm-faq__item"><div class="tpm-faq__item-hd"><h3 class="tpm-faq__item-title">如何开始使用联网搜索API？</h3><i class="tpm-faq__item-icon"></i></div></div><div class="tpm-faq__item"><div class="tpm-faq__item-hd"><h3 class="tpm-faq__item-title">为什么子账号调用后显示未授权？</h3><i class="tpm-faq__item-icon"></i></div></div><div class="tpm-faq__item"><div class="tpm-faq__item-hd"><h3 class="tpm-faq__item-title">是否可以直接使用主账号接入测试？</h3><i class="tpm-faq__item-icon"></i></div></div><div class="tpm-faq__item"><div class="tpm-faq__item-hd"><h3 class="tpm-faq__item-title">为什么显示开通失败？</h3><i class="tpm-faq__item-icon"></i></div></div></div><div style="margin-top:40px;padding-bottom:60px" id="Q8UKPGOEz-" data-id="Q8UKPGOEz-"><div class="view-column" style="text-align:center"><div class="tpm-rich-text"><p class="ts-p">更多问题请查看 <a class="ts-link" href="https://cloud.tencent.com/document/faq">常见问题</a>，也可在 <a class="ts-link" href="https://cloud.tencent.com/developer/ask">问答社区</a> 中进行提问 。</p></div></div></div></div><div class="tl-call2action" id="UTpySBVfZ" data-id="UTpySBVfZ"><div class="tpm-2-action-panel has-qrcodes has-event"><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__inner"><main class="tpm-2-action-panel__main"><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__desc">按照我们的使用指南，开通服务后，即可调用联网搜索API。</div><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__btns"><a class="tpm-btn tpm-btn--white-hole" href="https://console.cloud.tencent.com/wsapi/index"><span class="tpm-btn__text">开始使用</span></a></div></main><aside class="tpm-2-action-panel__side"><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__qrcodes"><div class="tpm-qrcode"><div class="tpm-qrcode__img"><img src="https://qcloudimg.tencent-cloud.cn/trisys/assets/product/images/S_OuQUeeiDtQwlqjDXCZD.png" alt=""/></div><div class="tpm-qrcode__text">腾讯联网搜索API产品交流群</div></div></div><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__event"><div class="tpm-2-action-panel__event-desc">如果您有任何使用上的问题障碍或者建议，欢迎扫码入群和我们交流。</div></div></aside></div></div></div><div id="doc-container"></div></div></div>
    </div>
    
